{"chars": "Thin silver lines, glowing softly in the aurora light. One rune, near the base of her right antler: a little slipper-shaped cup under a sweeping crown. Wait. Then another, a little higher: a star of five petals around a round cup. Balance. Then a little hood with a curling ear and a lip spreading below. Listen. Then a single stem with flowers held all along it. Belong. Then a straight stem with a spiral winding up it. Hope. And at the very tip, a little circle of leaves with a fringed spike rising from it. Gratitude. They were the six Snow Orchids themselves, blooming in silver light.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 1.35, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 3.575, 3.688, 3.688, 3.688, 3.688, 3.962, 3.962, 3.962, 3.962, 3.962, 4.3, 4.35, 4.35, 4.35, 4.35, 4.35, 4.537, 4.537, 4.537, 4.537, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.625, 4.912, 4.912, 4.912, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.388, 5.388, 5.388, 5.388, 5.388, 5.388, 5.388, 6.0, 6.1, 6.1, 6.162, 6.162, 6.162, 6.162, 6.162, 6.162, 6.162, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 6.438, 7.088, 7.088, 7.088, 7.088, 7.312, 7.312, 7.312, 7.312, 7.312, 7.312, 7.5, 7.5, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.75, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 9.45, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.55, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 9.75, 10.1, 10.15, 10.15, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.525, 10.525, 10.525, 10.525, 10.525, 10.525, 10.525, 11.025, 11.125, 11.125, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.512, 11.512, 11.512, 11.637, 11.637, 11.637, 11.637, 11.637, 12.0, 12.0, 